[Intro]

[Verse 1]
[00:27.14]The snow is gone where the snow had stayed
[00:29.74]The wolves have walked back to the trees
[00:32.36]The river that was iron and stone
[00:34.63]Doth singeth now and runneth free

[00:37.51]The vǫlva paid, the gods did wake
[00:39.73]The fields are green, the bees are loud
[00:42.50]We owe a debt we cannot name
[00:44.75]So we shall pay it well, and proud!

[Pre-Chorus]
[00:50.13]Sól! Sumar! Mjǫðr!
[00:52.66]Sól! Sumar! Mjǫðr!

[Chorus]
[00:55.22]Skál! Til Sumarmál!
[00:57.80]Skál! Til Skogarmóðir!
[01:00.32]Drink the long sun down to the dregs of the night
[01:05.01]The night that doth never come!
[01:07.89]Bjórr ok bál! Bjórr ok bál!
[01:10.39]Beer and bonfire till dawn!
[01:14.93]The year we buried the snow alive
[01:19.72]And we danceth upon its barrow!

[Verse 2]
[01:33.16]Old Bjarki, he weepeth no more in his ale
[01:35.78]For a woman hath sat on his knee
[01:38.13]She is not the one he weepeth about
[01:40.76]But the summer doth careth not, see!

[01:43.26]Young Hrafn on the table is dancing again
[01:45.75]With a wreath on his head and his boots in his hand
[01:48.54]The priest at the door is the priest no more
[01:50.80]He is one of us now, he doth understand!

[Pre-Chorus]
[01:56.20]Sól! Sumar! Mjǫðr!
[01:58.80]Sól! Sumar! Mjǫðr!

[Chorus]
[02:01.32]Skál! Til Sumarmál!
[02:03.85]Skál! Til Skogarmóðir!
[02:06.44]Drink the long sun down to the dregs of the night
[02:11.14]The night that doth never come!
[02:14.00]Bjórr ok bál! Bjórr ok bál!
[02:16.56]Beer and bonfire till dawn!
[02:20.87]The year we buried the snow alive
[02:26.17]And we danceth upon its barrow!

[Bridge]
[02:34.18]Hej!
[02:39.24]To the woman who out-drinketh the smith!
[02:41.81]Hej!
[02:42.67]To the smith who out-drinketh the bear!
[02:44.20]Hej!
[02:44.81]To the bear who hath wandered into the feast!
[02:49.71]Hej!
[02:50.06]And to him we shall offer a chair!

[Breakdown]
[02:54.54]Who payeth?
[02:55.65]Not I!
[02:56.87]Who payeth?
[02:58.10]Not I!
[02:59.48]Who payeth?
[03:00.22]The vǫlva paid! And the vǫlva drinks free!

[Final Chorus]
[03:17.45]Skál! Til Sumarmál!
[03:20.05]Skál! Til Skogarmóðir!
[03:22.55]Drink the long sun down to the dregs of the night
[03:27.48]The night that doth never come!
[03:30.00]Bjórr ok bál! Bjórr ok bál!
[03:32.72]Beer and bonfire till dawn!
[03:37.02]The year we buried the snow alive
[03:42.44]And we danceth upon its barrow!

[Outro]
[03:50.70]SKÁL!
